request.description:
Global citizen aggregation. Response:
{
  total, active, inactive,
  profileStatuses: { incomplete, pending_review, approved, rejected }
}

Returns full citizen profile with counts and actions.

deactivation: null when active. When inactive:
{ reason, deactivated_at, deactivated_by: { id, name } }

counts: { applications, licenses, fines, unpaid_fines }

actions: { can_activate, can_deactivate, can_edit, can_view_applications, can_view_licenses, can_view_fines, can_view_audit_logs }

Employee/Admin id → 404 (does not disclose account type).
